        "statement": "Based on the specification document for the AOFD-120 power supply, answer the following questions.",
        "question": [
            "(A) What is the nominal voltage of the AOFD120-24 model?\n(B) What is the setting voltage range for the AOFD120-48 model?\n(C) What is the rated power for both models?",
