    "spec_60": {
        "statement": "Based on the document pages from the specification of the LTC1749 ADC, answer the following questions.",
        "question": [
            "What is the primary function of the ADC in the LTC1749 as described in the document? (A) Digital Signal Processing (DSP), (B) Digital-to-Analog Conversion (DAC), (C) Analog-to-Digital Conversion (ADC), (D) Voltage Regulation",
