            "What does the graph in Figure 6 represent?\n(A) THD+N vs Frequency\n(B) THD+N vs Temperature\n(C) THD+N vs Output Power\n(D) THD+N vs Input Voltage",
            "Refer to Figure 3: What is the trend in THD+N as frequency increases from 100 Hz to 10 kHz at a constant power output of 10W?",
