            "From the graph, THD+N shows an upward trend as frequency increases, especially at a higher power output of 10W.",
            "Using the slope from the graph in Figure 11, you can calculate: Slope = (50 - 0) / (4 - 0) = 12.5 W/V. Output Power = 12.5 * 2.5V = 31.25W."
