            "Fill in the blank: The U4256BM operates with a crystal reference oscillator frequency from ___ MHz to 15 MHz.",
            "Calculate the maximum drain voltage (V_D) allowed for the output current switches of the U4256BM."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "multi",
            "blank",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            [
                "A",
                "B",
                "D"
            ],
            "0.1",
            "15 V"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The block diagram includes a phase detector, band-gap, and DAC, but not an RF amplifier.",
            "According to the operating range, the crystal reference oscillator frequency starts at 0.1 MHz.",
            "The absolute maximum ratings section specifies the drain voltage switches have a maximum of 15 V."
        ],
