channel does not support Ioff when VDD=0\n17-0002\n\nBased on the provided specification document of an electronic device, answer the following questions.",
        "question": [
            "What is the minimum input leakage current (I_LK) for the SDA/SCL interfaces when the DDC switch is off, with Vin=5.5V? \n(A) -50 uA \n(B) 0 uA \n(C) 50 uA \n(D) 100 uA",
            "Determine the order of port selection when PRI_SEL = M.",
            "Calculate the typical switch output voltage (V_pass) for the CAB interface when V_I=3.3V, I_I=100uA."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "open",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "(A) -50 uA",
            "port3/port1/port2",
            "3.5 V"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The minimum input leakage current (I_LK) for the SDA/SCL interface is provided in the document as -50 uA when the DDC switch is off, and Vin=5.5V.",
            "According to the note in the document, the order of port selection when PRI_SEL = M is port3/port1/port2.",
            "The typical V_pass for the CAB interface is listed as 3.5 V when V_I=3.3V and I_I=100uA."
        ],
