            "The document specifies '4 differential pair I/O' for the ports, indicating support for differential signaling.",
            "The diagram and the document describe differential pairs for DP/HDMI, which are controlled through a muxing system to manage inputs and outputs.",
            "Each differential pair requires two pins. Since there are 4 pairs for each 'D0, D1, D2, D3' related to HDMI and DP, the total is 4 pairs \u00d7 2 pins/pair \u00d7 5 configurations = 40 pins."
        ],
