        "question": [
            "What is the typical package type of the PDSP1601 MC? (A) PD100 (B) GC100 (C) SC70 (D) PLCC20",
            "Fill in the blank: The input low voltage (V_IL) for PDSP1601 MC is between ______ to 0.5V.",
            "Calculate the maximum total power dissipation if the package thermal resistance (\u03b8_jc) is 12 \u00b0C/W and the junction to ambient temperature difference is 60\u00b0C."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "blank",
            "open"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "(B) GC100",
            "0.8V",
            "5W"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The package type is listed as GC100 under the pin configuration section.",
            "The input low voltage (V_IL) is shown as 0.8V to 0.5V under the static characteristics.",
            "Using the formula: Power = (Temperature Difference) / (Thermal Resistance) = 60\u2103 / 12\u2103/W = 5W."
        ],
