            "Figure 3 in the document is labeled as the Dynamic Power Dissipation Test Circuit.",
            "The logic diagram in Figure 5 details how the device uses logic gates to add binary numbers, which is the primary function of the adder.",
            "The formula given for propagation delay is: t_PD(total) = t_PD(Carry to Carry) + t_PD(Sum to Carry) + 2 * t_PD(Carry to Sum). For 15 V, the value is t_PHLL + t_PHLL = 90 ns."
        ],
