Notes 9, 10 (ns)\nMinimum Cycle Time\nHighgoing Pulse\nLowgoing Pulse\nL4C381-25*\nL4C381-20*\n20\n18\n8\n6\n8\n6\nL4C381-20*\nF15-F0\nP, G\nOVF, Z\nC16\n14\n20\n20\n20\n\u2014\n\u2014\n16\n16\n\u2014\n18\n20\n18\n20\n20\n20\n20\n17\n\u2014\n16\n16\n20\n18\n20\n18\n\u2014\n17\n20\n17\n14\n\u2014\n\u2014\n\u2014\n\u2014\n\u2014\n16\n16\n\u2014\n18\n20\n18\n20\n17\n20\n17\n20\n20\n20\n20\n17\n\u2014\n16\n16\n20\n18\n20\n18\n123456789012345678901234\n123456789012345678901234\n123456789012345678901234\n123456789012345678901234\n*DISCONTINUED SPEED GRADE\n\nBased on the given specification document of the L4C381 16-bit Cascadable ALU, answer the following questions.",
        "question": [
            "What is the minimum cycle time for the L4C381-55 model in commercial operating range?",
            "Determine the setup and hold time required for the input C0 on the L4C381-26 when FTAB=0 in commercial operating range.",
            "Calculate the difference in maximum combinational delay from Clock to P, G for L4C381-65 and L4C381-45 when FTAB=0, FTF=0 in military operating range."
        ],
