        "explanation": [
            "The minimum cycle time for the L4C381-55 in commercial operating range is 34 ns, which is the smallest among the listed options.",
            "For the L4C381-26 with FTAB=0, the setup time is 8 ns and hold time is 0 ns as specified in the setup and hold time table.",
