            "blank",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "(B) Arithmetic and logic operations",
            "Clear (F = 00...00)",
            "2.4 V"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The L4C381 is described in the document as a 16-bit Cascadable Arithmetic and Logic Unit (ALU) that performs arithmetic and logic operations.",
            "The ALU functions table in the document specifies that when S2, S1 and S0 are all 0, the function is 'CLEAR (F = 00...00)'.",
            "According to the electrical characteristics, at VCC = Minimum and IOH = -2.0 mA, the minimum VOH is 2.4 V."
        ],
