            "multi",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "(B) 2C2CH",
            "(C) DEECTRL",
            "000"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The default value of the AVOL register is 2C2CH as shown in the specification document.",
            "DEECTRL is used to control de-emphasis externally as stated in the pin description.",
            "For a sample rate of 32-48 kHz, the bits [2:0] should be set to 000."
        ],
