            "According to the note in the diagram, R2 is used to determine the comparison threshold for the photodiode, ensuring minimal leakage.",
            "The resistors in series with the input are R7 (15k\u03a9) and another resistor of 24k\u03a9, summing up to 39k\u03a9."
        ],
