        "question": [
            "Which MOSFET Package is used in the 3-Phase Bridge with a Diode Type rated at V_RRM=1600V? \n(A) SP1 \n(B) SM1 \n(C) SM2 \n(D) SM3",
            "Determine if the following statement is true or false: The SiC MOSFET in the T-Type 3-Level Inverter configuration at V_CES=600/1200V has a lower R_DS(on) than the one in the 3-Level NPC Inverter configuration at the same voltage.",
            "Calculate the total R_DS(on) for two MOSFETs in the Triple Phase Leg configuration with V_DSS=1000V connected in parallel."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "blank",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "A",
            "True",
            "175 m\u03a9"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The document lists SP1 as the package used in the 3-Phase Bridge with a Diode Type rated at V_RRM=1600V.",
            "For the T-Type 3-Level Inverter, the R_DS(on) is given as 40 m\u03a9. The 3-Level NPC Inverter's lowest R_DS(on) is 55 m\u03a9. 40 m\u03a9 is indeed less than 55 m\u03a9.",
            "Each MOS7 MOSFET has R_DS(on) of 350 m\u03a9. When two are in parallel, the total resistance is 175 m\u03a9 (350 m\u03a9 / 2)."
        ],
        "difficulty": [
            "easy",
            "medium",
            "medium"
        ],
        "ability": [
            "perception",
            "inference",
            "computation"
        ],
