        "question": [
            "Which technology is used in a 600V module with a current rating of 50A and a package type of SP3? \n(A) Mix Trench IGBT \n(B) TRENCH 3 \n(C) COolMOS \n(D) NPT IGBT",
            "In a 1200V full bridge module with Mix Trench IGBT, what is the common Vces rating (in V) at rated Ic?",
            "Calculate the power loss if a SIC diode module operates at a forward current (IF) of 10A with a VF of 1.6V."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "blank",
            "open"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "A",
            "3.2",
            "16 Watts"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "For the specified module, the technology used is 'Mix Trench IGBT & NPT IGBT'.",
            "In the 1200V full bridge module, the Vces at rated Ic for Mix Trench IGBT is typically 3.2V.",
            "Power loss is calculated using P = IF \u00d7 VF, so 10A \u00d7 1.6V = 16 Watts."
        ],
