        "question": [
            "What is the maximum current rating (I_D) at T_c=80\u00b0C for the MOSFET with a V_DSS of 200V and R_DS(on) of 8m\u03a9? (A) 147A (B) 125A (C) 140A",
            "Which package is used for the MOSFET with a V_DSS of 1000V and R_DS(on) of 130m\u03a9?",
            "Calculate the power dissipation at T_c=80\u00b0C for a MOSFET with I_D=100A and R_DS(on)=4.5m\u03a9."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "blank",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "A",
            "SP6",
            "45W"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "Looking at the tables, the MOSFET with V_DSS=200V and R_DS(on)=8m\u03a9 uses FREDFET 7 and has an I_D of 147A at T_c=80\u00b0C.",
            "The table under 'Phase Leg series diodes' shows that the MOSFET with V_DSS=1000V and R_DS(on)=130m\u03a9 uses the SP6 package.",
            "Power dissipation, P = I^2 * R = 100^2 * 0.0045 = 45W. This formula calculates the power based on current and resistance."
        ],
