        "question": [
            "Which of the following MOSFET technologies is mentioned in the document? (A) C6 Technology, (B) DQ Technology, (C) DS Technology, (D) DL Technology",
            "From the document, list at least two features of Ultra Fast Recovery Diodes.",
            "Calculate the typical power loss, in watts, for a MOSFET with R_DS(on) = 0.120 ohms and I_D = 10 A."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "multi",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "A",
            "Low Vf, Ultra-soft recovery, Avalanche rated",
            "12"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "C6 Technology is directly mentioned in the document under the MOSFET section.",
            "The document lists features such as Low Vf, Ultra-soft recovery, and Avalanche rated for these diodes.",
            "The power loss (P_loss) for a MOSFET can be calculated using the formula: P_loss = I_D^2 * R_DS(on). Substituting the given values: P_loss = 10^2 * 0.120 = 12 watts."
        ],
        "difficulty": [
            "easy",
            "medium",
            "medium"
        ],
        "ability": [
            "perception",
            "perception",
            "computation"
        ],
        "ic_type": "analog",
        "image": [],
        "modality": "text",
        "source": "datasheet",
