        "question": [
            "(A) Which technology is used in the Power MOS 8TM IGBT section? (A) NPT Technology (B) PT Technology (C) Thunderbolt Technology (D) Fast Switching Technology",
            "Identify the maximum Ic at frequency of 25kHz for the part number APT70GT120B2 in the document.",
            "Calculate the change in Vce(sat) when temperature increases from 25\u00b0C to 100\u00b0C for a given part with Vce(sat) values of 2.5V and 4.5V, respectively."
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "blank",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "A",
            "66A",
            "2.0V"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The document specifies that Power MOS 8TM uses NPT Technology under the IGBT section.",
            "The part number APT70GT120B2 shows a maximum Ic at frequency of 25kHz is 66A.",
            "The change in Vce(sat) at 100\u00b0C - Vce(sat) at 25\u00b0C = 4.5V - 2.5V = 2.0V."
        ],
        "difficulty": [
