        "question": [
            "What is the typical frequency range for the Master Clock in the 256fs mode? (A) 2.048 - 24.576 MHz (B) 3.072 - 36.864 MHz (C) 4.096 - 24.576 MHz (D) 6.144 - 36.864 MHz",
            "Explain the significance of tBCKL and tBCKH in the BICK Timing, Slave mode.",
