        "question": [
            "Which characteristic of the ADC input is shown to have a dynamic range (DR) of 98 dB at a sampling frequency (fs) of 48kHz? (A) with gain 0 dB, (B) with gain +15 dB, (C) A-weighted, (D) no information.",
            "Considering the document's filter characteristics, which statement is true? (A) The Passband for the Sharp Roll-Off filter at fs=48kHz maxes at 20.0 kHz, (B) The Stopband Attenuation for the Short Delay Sharp Roll-Off filter at fs=96kHz is 71 dB, (C) The Group Delay for the HPF at fs=96kHz is 13.0 Hz, (D) The Passband for the Sharp Roll-Off filter at fs=96kHz maxes at 37.6 kHz.",
            "Calculate the power supply current in Normal Operation if VA = 3.4 mA, VD(fs=48kHz) = 1.9 mA, and VD(fs=96kHz) = 3.7 mA. Fill in the blank: Total current = ____ mA"
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "single",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "(A) with gain 0 dB",
            "(D) The Passband for the Sharp Roll-Off filter at fs=96kHz maxes at 37.6 kHz.",
            "9.0 mA"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The document indicates that at a sampling frequency (fs) of 48kHz with gain of 0 dB, the DR is specified as 90 min and 98 typ dB.",
            "According to the document, for the Sharp Roll-Off filter at fs=96kHz, the maximum Passband (PB) is 37.6 kHz.",
            "The total power supply current for normal operation is the sum of VA and VD at both fs=48kHz and fs=96kHz, i.e., 3.4 + 1.9 + 3.7 = 9.0 mA."
        ],
