            "For a Gain of 0dB, the min and max input voltage values are 2.7 V and 3.3 V respectively.",
            "The maximum power supply current consumption for VA is 5.7 mA, and for VD at fs=96kHz is 6.7 mA, thus totaling 12.4 mA."
