        "question": [
            "What is the maximum clock frequency supported by the AK5720? (A) 256fs (B) 384fs (C) 512fs (D) 768fs",
            "Determine the correct sequence for the audio data format specified in the AK5720. (Choose two) (A) 2's complement (B) MSB First (C) LSB First (D) Sign-magnitude",
