        ],
        "question_type": [
            "single",
            "multi",
            "blank"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "D",
            [
                "A",
                "B"
            ],
            "6.1"
        ],
        "explanation": [
            "The maximum clock frequency supported by the AK5720 is listed as 768fs in the specifications.",
            "According to the specifications, the audio data format for the AK5720 uses both 2's complement and MSB First.",
            "The specified current consumption is given as 6.1mA for VA=VD=5.0V, fs=48kHz. Since the document doesn't specify different values for varying VA or VD for computation-related functionality, one can assume that this value remains constant under the given conditions."
        ],
